                  "multiple": false,
                  "typeClass": "primitive",
                  "value": "Jan Lucassen & Rombert Stapel, Shifts in Labour Relations in India 1800-2000 (2014) presented at the 10th International Conference on Labour History, Noida (India), 22-24 March 2014."
                }
              },
              {
